msgid "Too many failed attempts. Password verification has been suspended for 10 minutes. Please try again later."
msgstr "验证失败次数过多，已暂停密码验证 10 分钟，请稍后重试。"

#: includes/trait-maintenance.php:37
msgid "Ask the panel owner to apply Standard or Strict file lock before enabling maintenance."
msgstr "请面板所有者先重新应用标准或严格文件锁，再开启临时维护。"

