msgstr "FastCGI 缓存"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:375
msgid "Image handling"
msgstr "图片处理"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:382
msgid "Component updates"
msgstr "组件更新"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:385
#, php-format
msgid "Version %s available"
msgstr "发现版本 %s"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:385
msgid "Up to date"
msgstr "已是最新版本"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:393
msgid "An update is available for this managed plugin."
msgstr "这个托管插件有新版本可用。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:394
#, php-format
msgid "WP Panel can update this plugin from version %1$s to %2$s. The update will not change whether the plugin is active."
msgstr "WP Panel 可以将插件从 %1$s 更新到 %2$s，更新不会改变插件当前的启用或停用状态。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:396
msgid "Update now"
msgstr "立即更新"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:415
msgid "Configuration file missing"
msgstr "配置文件缺失"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:415
msgid "Open the site details page for this website in the WP Panel and click the \"Install companion plugin\" button on the WordPress optimization card to complete initialization."
msgstr "请在 WP Panel 面板中进入该网站详情页，点击 WordPress 优化卡片的「安装配套插件」按钮完成初始化。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:428
msgid "Core cache switch"
msgstr "核心缓存开关"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:430
msgid "Helps visitors open pages faster and reduces repeated server work for the same content."
msgstr "让访客更快打开页面，同时减少服务器重复处理相同内容。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:436
msgid "Ideal for blogs and business sites that mostly serve public content."
msgstr "适合博客、企业官网等以公开内容为主的网站。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:442
msgid "Enable FastCGI cache"
msgstr "开启 FastCGI 缓存"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:446
msgid "The plugin clears the site cache automatically when content or comments change."
msgstr "内容或评论发生变化时，插件会自动清除站点缓存。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:449
msgid "Details"
msgstr "查看说明"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:451
msgid "Logged-in users never get cached pages. Common dynamic requests such as shopping carts are also excluded from the cache by server rules."
msgstr "登录后台的用户不会读取页面缓存。购物车等常见动态请求也会按服务器规则跳过缓存。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:452
msgid "If the front end does not update immediately after saving content, use \"Clear Nginx cache\" below. If a CDN is also in use, its cache must be cleared at the CDN provider as well."
msgstr "保存内容后，如果前台没有立即更新，可以使用页面下方的“清除 Nginx 缓存”。如果网站还使用了 CDN，也需要到 CDN 服务商处清除缓存。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:462
#: includes/trait-settings.php:468
msgid "Cache lifetime"
msgstr "缓存有效期"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:463
msgid "How long a cached copy is kept before it is regenerated automatically."
msgstr "单份缓存保留多久后自动重新生成。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:469
msgid "Regenerated automatically when it expires; no manual cleanup is required."
msgstr "到期后自动重建，无需手动清理。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:473
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s300%2$s seconds equal 5 minutes. For most sites, %1$s300–3600%2$s seconds works well."
msgstr "%1$s300%2$s 秒等于 5 分钟。一般网站可使用 %1$s300–3600%2$s 秒。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:474
msgid "Longer lifetimes reduce server load; the cache can still be cleared automatically or manually after content updates."
msgstr "时间越长，服务器压力越小；内容更新后仍可自动或手动清除缓存。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:482
msgid "Cache preload"
msgstr "缓存预加载"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:483
msgid "After the cache is cleared, the plugin visits commonly used pages so they are already cached for the next visitor."
msgstr "清除缓存后，提前访问常用页面，让第一位访客也能快速打开。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:488
msgid "Preload automatically after cache clear"
msgstr "清除缓存后自动预加载"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:489
msgid "Processed slowly in the background, never hitting many pages at once."
msgstr "以较慢速度在后台处理，不会一次访问大量页面。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:495
msgid "Enable automatic preload"
msgstr "开启自动预加载"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:499
#, php-format
msgid "Preloading only takes effect after the %1$sFastCGI cache%2$s above is enabled."
msgstr "需要先开启上方的 %1$sFastCGI 缓存%2$s，预加载才会生效。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:502
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:502
msgid "Visits public pages automatically to build their cache."
msgstr "自动访问公开页面并生成缓存。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:503
#: includes/trait-settings.php:593
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:503
msgid "Prioritizes the home page and recently updated public content; it does not crawl the whole site."
msgstr "优先处理首页和最近更新的公开内容，不会遍历整个网站。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:504
msgid "Other pages"
msgstr "其他页面"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:504
msgid "These pages are cached the first time someone visits them."
msgstr "会在访客第一次打开时正常生成缓存。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:510
msgid "Max URLs per preload run"
msgstr "单次最多预加载 URL"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:511
msgid "The maximum number of URLs processed in a single preload run."
msgstr "一轮预加载最多处理多少个地址。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:515
#, php-format
msgid "Range %1$s10–500%2$s; %1$s100%2$s is a common choice. The home page comes first, followed by recently updated public posts, pages, and term archives."
msgstr "范围 %1$s10–500%2$s；常用 %1$s100%2$s。首页优先，其次为最近更新的公开文章、页面和分类归档。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:526
msgid "Image processing is unavailable: the server is missing the exif extension."
msgstr "服务器缺少 exif 扩展，暂不支持图片处理。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:526
#, php-format
msgid "This feature relies on the PHP %1$sexif%2$s extension to correct photo orientation. Once the panel has installed it, refresh this page to start using it."
msgstr "该功能依赖 PHP %1$sexif%2$s 扩展做拍照方向修正，面板补装完成后刷新本页即可使用。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:532
msgid "Image handling for new uploads"
msgstr "新上传图片处理"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:533
msgid "Chooses how newly uploaded images are processed; published content is not affected."
msgstr "决定新增图片上传时的处理方式，不影响已发布内容。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:538
msgid "Processing mode"
msgstr "处理模式"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:539
msgid "Compress or convert on upload to reduce file size."
msgstr "上传时自动压缩或转换格式，减小体积。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:547
msgid "Keep the default WordPress behavior: no conversion or compression on upload."
msgstr "保持 WordPress 默认行为，上传时不做任何转换或压缩。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:554
msgid "JPEG files are compressed at the selected quality, while PNG files are optimized losslessly. File formats and URLs remain unchanged."
msgstr "JPEG 按所选质量压缩，PNG 进行无损压缩；图片格式和访问地址保持不变。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:561
msgid "Convert to smaller WebP files and remove the original. Current versions of Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari, and other major browsers all display WebP."
msgstr "转换为体积更小的 WebP 并删除原图。2026 年的 Chrome、Edge、Firefox 和 Safari 等主流浏览器均可正常显示 WebP。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:567
msgid "JPEG quality"
msgstr "JPEG 质量"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:571
msgid "WebP quality"
msgstr "WebP 质量"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:576
#, php-format
msgid "Modern browsers display WebP reliably. WebP mode does %1$snot keep the original%2$s, so test older plugins, email templates, social sharing, and external services that may require JPEG or PNG files."
msgstr "现代浏览器都能可靠显示 WebP。WebP 模式%1$s不保留原图%2$s，因此需要测试可能依赖 JPEG 或 PNG 文件的旧插件、邮件模板、社交分享和外部服务。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:579
#, php-format
msgid "%d images could not be converted (unsupported file format, or the converted file would have been larger, etc.); the originals were kept automatically and uploads are unaffected."
msgstr "有 %d 张图片未能转换成功（文件格式不受支持、转换后体积反而更大等原因），已自动保留原图，不影响正常上传。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:588
msgid "Optimize existing Media Library images"
msgstr "历史图库批量优化"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:589
msgid "Re-encode existing media library images in place to save space."
msgstr "对媒体库里已有的历史图片做原地重编码，减小占用。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:593
msgid "Only existing JPEG and PNG images in the Media Library are processed."
msgstr "仅处理媒体库里已有的历史 JPEG / PNG。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:594
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方式"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:594
msgid "Lossless in-place re-encoding: file names stay the same, no WebP copies are created, and image references in published content are untouched."
msgstr "原地无损重编码，不改文件名、不生成 WebP 副本、不影响已发布内容里的图片引用。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:595
msgid "Execution"
msgstr "执行"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:595
msgid "The task runs on WP Panel in the background; you can close this page once it starts."
msgstr "任务由 WP Panel 在后台处理，开始后可以关闭本页面。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:599
msgid "Job status"
msgstr "任务状态"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:600
#: includes/trait-settings.php:907
#: includes/trait-settings.php:1011
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "空闲"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:603
msgid "Total saved"
msgstr "累计节省"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:611
msgid "Start batch optimization"
msgstr "开始批量优化"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:612
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:613
msgid "Speed is controlled by the panel; large libraries can take a while."
msgstr "处理速度由面板控制，图库较大时任务会持续一段时间。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:621
msgid "File protection is enabled. Settings that modify wp-config.php are read-only; other settings and actions remain available."
msgstr "文件保护已开启。需要修改 wp-config.php 的设置为只读，其他设置和操作仍可正常使用。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:625
msgid "WordPress hardening"
msgstr "WordPress 加固"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:626
msgid "Reduce unnecessary WordPress access points while keeping security settings synchronized with WP Panel."
msgstr "减少不必要的 WordPress 访问入口，并与 WP Panel 保持安全设置同步。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:631
msgid "Disable update checks"
msgstr "禁止检测更新"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:632
msgid "Hides update notices in the WordPress dashboard. Designed for business sites that receive infrequent maintenance."
msgstr "隐藏后台更新提醒，适合建成后较少维护的企业网站。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:638
msgid "Block update checks for core, plugins, and themes"
msgstr "屏蔽核心、插件与主题的更新检测"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:641
#: includes/trait-settings.php:743
msgid "When enabled"
msgstr "开启后"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:641
msgid "WordPress no longer checks for or displays update notices for core, plugins, and themes."
msgstr "WordPress 不再检查或显示核心、插件和主题的更新提醒。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:642
msgid "Security risk"
msgstr "安全风险"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:642
msgid "Skipping updates for a long time leaves known vulnerabilities unpatched. Do not treat \"no notices\" as \"no updates needed\"."
msgstr "长期不更新可能遗留已公开的安全漏洞，请不要把“没有提醒”理解为“无需更新”。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:643
#: includes/trait-settings.php:701
#: includes/trait-settings.php:762
#: includes/trait-settings.php:778
msgid "Recommendation"
msgstr "建议"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:643
msgid "Turn this setting off periodically to check for updates, or manage updates from \"WP Overview\" in WP Panel. Re-enable the site file lock when maintenance is complete."
msgstr "定期临时关闭此开关检查更新，或通过 WP Panel 的“WP 总览”管理更新；完成后再开启网站文件锁定。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:649
msgid "Disable file editing"
msgstr "禁止文件编辑"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:650
msgid "Removes the dashboard code editors, reducing the chance of injected code."
msgstr "关闭后台的代码编辑入口，减少被写入的可能。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:656
msgid "Prevent editing theme and plugin files in the dashboard"
msgstr "禁止在后台编辑主题和插件文件"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:658
msgid "Recommended. It only disables the built-in dashboard code editors; post editing and media uploads are not affected."
msgstr "建议开启。它只关闭 WordPress 后台自带的代码编辑器，不影响文章编辑和媒体上传。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:663
msgid "Enable debug mode"
msgstr "启用调试模式"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:664
msgid "Logs PHP errors to a file for troubleshooting."
msgstr "记录 PHP 错误到日志，用于排查故障。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:670
msgid "Enable the debug log"
msgstr "开启调试日志"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:673
msgid "Use"
msgstr "用途"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:673
msgid "Diagnose white screens, 500 errors, or plugin faults."
msgstr "排查白屏、500 错误或插件故障。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:674
msgid "Note"
msgstr "注意"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:674
msgid "Enable only temporarily while troubleshooting; turn it off afterwards."
msgstr "只在排查问题时临时开启，完成后请关闭。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:677
#: includes/trait-settings.php:715
msgid "More details"
msgstr "更多说明"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:679
#, php-format
msgid "Errors are written to %1$s and are not shown to visitors by default. To display errors on the page temporarily, configure it on the site details page in WP Panel."
msgstr "错误会写入 %1$s，默认不会显示给访客。需要临时在页面显示错误时，请到 WP Panel 网站详情页设置。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:689
msgid "Resources & database"
msgstr "资源与数据库"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:694
msgid "Post revisions"
msgstr "文章修订版本数"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:695
msgid "Limit how many historical revisions each post keeps."
msgstr "限制每篇文章保留的历史版本数量。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:698
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:700
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "作用"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:700
msgid "Keeps past versions of a post so accidental edits can be restored."
msgstr "保留文章过去的版本，误改内容时可以恢复。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:701
#, php-format
msgid "A value of %1$s3–5%2$s works for most sites; leave empty for no limit."
msgstr "一般设置为 %1$s3–5%2$s；留空表示不限制数量。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:702
msgid "Entering 0"
msgstr "填 0"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:702
msgid "Disables revisions entirely; accidental edits can no longer be restored from revision history."
msgstr "完全关闭历史版本，误改后将无法从修订记录恢复。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:708
msgid "WordPress memory limit"
msgstr "WordPress 内存限制"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:709
msgid "Adjust only when memory exhaustion errors appear."
msgstr "只在出现内存不足错误时调整。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:712
msgid "Default 40M"
msgstr "默认 40M"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:713
#, php-format
msgid "Current PHP memory limit on this server: %1$s. If you are unsure, leave this blank. If more memory is needed, try %2$s or %3$s."
msgstr "当前服务器 PHP 内存上限：%1$s。不确定时请留空；需要调整时可填写 %2$s 或 %3$s。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:717
msgid "Increase this if you see \"Allowed memory size exhausted\" errors or memory-related white screens in the dashboard."
msgstr "遇到“Allowed memory size exhausted”或后台因内存不足白屏时，可适当调高。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:718
msgid "The value here cannot exceed the PHP memory limit shown above, which comes from the effective configuration in \"Software Management\" in WP Panel."
msgstr "这里的数值不能超过上方显示的 PHP 内存上限；该上限来自 WP Panel“软件管理”的实际生效配置。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:728
msgid "Security features managed by WP Panel"
msgstr "由 WP Panel 托管的安全功能"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:729
msgid "This plugin displays these settings as read-only. They can be changed only in WP Panel, so WordPress administrators cannot weaken server security policies."
msgstr "插件以只读方式显示这些设置；只能在 WP Panel 中修改，避免 WordPress 管理员降低服务器安全策略。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:734
msgid "File protection & temporary maintenance"
msgstr "文件保护与临时维护"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:735
msgid "Helps prevent accidental or malicious changes to plugins, themes, and other site code."
msgstr "帮助防止插件、主题和其他网站代码被意外或恶意修改。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:739
msgid "File protection enabled"
msgstr "文件保护已开启"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:739
msgid "File protection not enabled"
msgstr "文件保护未开启"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:740
msgid "Configured in WP Panel → Site details → File protection & temporary maintenance"
msgstr "在 WP Panel → 网站详情 → 文件保护与临时维护 中配置"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:743
msgid "Writing posts, editing pages, and uploading images are unaffected; installing, updating, or modifying program files is restricted."
msgstr "写文章、编辑页面和上传图片不受影响；安装、更新或修改程序文件会受到限制。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:744
msgid "During maintenance"
msgstr "需要维护"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:744
msgid "Use the maintenance password configured in the panel to unlock temporarily, then relock the site as soon as maintenance is complete."
msgstr "可使用面板设置的维护密码临时解锁，完成后应立即重新锁定。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:747
msgid "View temporary maintenance"
msgstr "查看临时维护"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:753
msgid "XML-RPC interface"
msgstr "XML-RPC 接口"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:754
msgid "A legacy remote connection API; most ordinary sites do not need it."
msgstr "旧式远程连接接口，大多数普通网站不需要开启。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:759
#: includes/trait-settings.php:775
msgid "Changed in WP Panel → Site details → WordPress optimization"
msgstr "在 WP Panel → 网站详情 → WordPress 优化 中修改"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:762
msgid "Keep it off unless you use Jetpack, an older mobile app, or remote publishing tools."
msgstr "没有使用 Jetpack、旧版手机 App 或远程发布工具时保持关闭。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:763
msgid "When to enable"
msgstr "开启条件"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:763
msgid "Enable only when a tool you rely on clearly cannot connect."
msgstr "只有明确遇到相关工具无法连接时才需要开启。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:769
msgid "WordPress application passwords"
msgstr "WordPress 应用程序密码"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:770
msgid "Let mobile apps, auto-publishing tools, and third-party services connect to your site."
msgstr "供手机 App、自动发布工具和第三方服务连接网站。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:774
msgid "Allowed"
msgstr "允许使用"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:778
msgid "Keep disabled on ordinary sites; enable when an external tool needs to connect."
msgstr "普通网站保持禁用，需要连接外部工具时再开启。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:779
msgid "Unaffected"
msgstr "不受影响"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:779
msgid "Disabling does not affect dashboard login, writing posts, or uploading images."
msgstr "禁用不会影响 WordPress 后台登录、写文章或上传图片。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:780
msgid "Existing passwords"
msgstr "已有密码"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:780
msgid "Disabling does not delete existing credentials; they keep working once re-enabled."
msgstr "禁用不会删除已有凭据；重新允许后仍可继续使用。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:786
msgid "WordPress anomaly monitoring"
msgstr "WordPress 异常监控"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:787
msgid "Periodically checks for changes to administrators, content, security settings, and unusual persisted database objects."
msgstr "定期检查管理员、内容、安全设置及异常持久化对象的变化。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:792
msgid "Configured and reviewed in WP Panel → Site details → WordPress anomaly monitoring"
msgstr "在 WP Panel → 网站详情 → WordPress 异常监控 中配置和查看记录"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:794
msgid "Anomalies are recorded and notified by the panel; files, users, or content are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "发现异常时由面板记录并通知，不会自动删除文件、用户或内容。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:799
msgid "Password reset policy"
msgstr "密码找回策略"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:800
msgid "Controls which users may reset their login password via \"Lost your password?\"."
msgstr "控制哪些用户可以通过“忘记密码”重设登录密码。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:805
msgid "Changed in WP Panel → Site details → Password reset protection"
msgstr "在 WP Panel → 网站详情 → 密码找回保护 中修改"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:807
msgid "Restricting resets reduces the risk of malicious admin password resets; a forgotten password then requires another administrator or the panel owner to recover."
msgstr "限制密码找回可减少管理员账号被恶意重置的风险，但忘记密码时需要由其他管理员或面板所有者协助恢复。"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:817
msgid "About & panel sync"
msgstr "关于与面板同步"

#: includes/trait-settings.php:820
msgid "WP Panel Optimizer is the companion plugin installed automatically by WP Panel. It connects caching, image handling, and common WordPress settings to the panel for centralized management."
msgstr "WP Panel Optimizer 是 WP Panel 自动安装的配套插件。它把缓存、图片和常用 WordPress 设置连接到面板，方便集中管理。"

